1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,080
A nearly 4,000-year-old Egyptian tomb painting

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,390
shows over a hundred men dragging a giant statue.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,190
One man isn't pulling.

4
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,770
He's pouring water.

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,030
Maybe a ritual.

6
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,190
But physicists tested it.

7
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,570
Water cut the pull roughly in half.

8
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,730
Not because wet sand is slippery.

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,470
Too much water makes it worse.

10
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,580
Just enough water glues the grains together,

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,240
so the sand doesn't pile up

12
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,150
in front of the sledge.
